        "because": "Human accepted the remaining finding: Owner asleep on 23 Nov 2026 and asked for the recommended choice: accept as a known issue. In a repo that tests two Python apps with separate pytest commands and the same unpackaged test module name in both, naming one app's test can add it to the other app's pytest run and fail collection",
